    {
      "source": "Adapts this value factory into a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Supplier.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Supplier</code></a> by using the given <a href=\"../dialect/Escaper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>Escaper</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将给定的<a href=\"../dialect/Escaper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>Escaper</code></a>用于将此值工厂适配为<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Supplier.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Supplier</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Produces a value by considering the given <a href=\"../dialect/Escaper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>Escaper</code></a>.",
      "translation": "根据给定的<a href=\"../dialect/Escaper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>Escaper</code></a>生成一个值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>escaper</code> - the escaper to use.",
      "translation": "<code>escaper</code> - 要使用的转义器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2017–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2017–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a new ValueFunction applying the given mapping <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Function</code></a>. The mapping function is applied after\napplying <a href=\"../dialect/Escaper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>Escaper</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回一个新的 ValueFunction，应用给定的映射<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Function</code></a>。该映射函数在应用<a href=\"../dialect/Escaper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>Escaper</code></a>之后执行。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a new ValueFunction applying the given mapping <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Function</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回一个新的 ValueFunction，该函数应用给定的映射 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Function</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Represents a value function to return arbitrary values that can be escaped before returning the actual value. Can be\nused with the criteria API for deferred value retrieval.",
      "translation": "表示一个值函数，用于在返回实际值之前对任意值进行转义。可与标准 API 配合使用，以实现延迟值检索。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html#apply(T)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\">apply</a></code> in interface <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\">Function</a>&lt;<a href=\"../dialect/Escaper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\">Escaper</a>, <a href=\"#type-param-T\" title=\"type parameter in ValueFunction\">T</a> extends @Nullable <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Object</a>&gt;</code>",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html#apply(T)\" title=\"类或接口在 java.util.function 中\">apply</a></code> 在接口 <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"类或接口在 java.util.function 中\">Function</a>&lt;<a href=\"../dialect/Escaper.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect 中的类\">Escaper</a>, <a href=\"#type-param-T\" title=\"ValueFunction 中的类型参数\">T</a> extends @Nullable <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"类或接口在 java.lang 中\">Object</a>&gt;</code>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span id=\"map(java.util.function.Function)-type-param-R\"><code>R</code> - the type of the value returned from the mapping function.</span>",
      "translation": "<span id=\"map(java.util.function.Function)-type-param-R\"><code>R</code> - 映射函数返回值的类型。</span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>mapper</code> - the mapping function to apply to the value.",
      "translation": "<code>mapper</code> - 应用于该值的映射函数。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "This is a functional interface and can therefore be used as the assignment target for a lambda expression or method reference.",
      "translation": "这是一个函数式接口，因此可以用作 Lambda 表达式或方法引用的赋值目标。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Mark Paluch",
      "translation": "马克·帕卢赫",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the return value, may be null.",
      "translation": "返回值可能为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the value factory",
      "translation": "价值工厂",
      "count": 1
